1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,731
Pseudo first order.

2
00:00:01,731 --> 00:00:07,317
When cane sugar is hydrolysed, one sugar molecule reacts with one water molecule.

3
00:00:07,317 --> 00:00:09,361
Truly, that is second order.

4
00:00:09,361 --> 00:00:13,281
But water is the solvent, a vast ocean of it.

5
00:00:13,281 --> 00:00:18,632
Using up a few molecules changes its concentration by almost nothing.

